# Agent workflow

1. Read the task and the files it touches. Map the screen ID (A1, A4, G1…) if UI.
2. If the feature is Later or TBD → stop and say so.
3. One slice only (A1 **or** auth **or** composer — not search + calendar + ads).
4. Reuse Post / FieldRenderer / existing `lib/` helpers. No new package without a perf reason.
5. Ship indexes, pagination, and column lists **in the same change**.

## Protected

`.env` and secrets. Unscoped `select`. RLS bypass “just for now.” Unrelated refactors.

## Done checklist

- [ ] Happy path works at mobile width
- [ ] Query has `community_id` (or chat membership); authz matches role+scope
- [ ] List is paginated / limited; no `select('*')`; no N+1 unread `COUNT`
- [ ] Hot path follows `performance.mdc` (bundle, queries, Realtime, images)
- [ ] No Later feature added “while here”
- [ ] Typecheck on touched TS
